{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50876","headline":"省题诗二十一首 三峡闻猿 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 三峡闻猿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟韎楚峡，孤櫂下巫云。\n正值三声断，仍教五夜闻。\n凄凄流洞壑，杳杳透烟氛。\n灩澦秋归尽，阳台曙欲分。\n何人悲失计，几度恨离羣。\n听後盈巾泪，家山接海濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}